  "body": "Key Features:\r\n\r\n-Existing three-bedroom home\r\n-Concept plans available for an impressive 268sqm (approx.) five-bedroom residence\r\n-607sqm (more or less) freehold site\r\n-Residential - Mixed Housing Suburban zoning\r\n-Elevated position enjoying excellent sun\r\n-Water and wastewater infrastructure nearby\r\n-Close to Waiake Beach, Long Bay Regional Park and Browns Bay\r\n-Offered on an \"as is, where is\" basis\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure freehold land in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal suburbs are becoming increasingly rare. Situated on an elevated 607sqm (more or less) site in sought-after Waiake, this property presents builders, developers, investors and visionaries with the opportunity to create something truly special.\r\n\r\nFurther enhancing its appeal, concept plans have already been prepared for an impressive two-level residence of approximately 268sqm, featuring a contemporary five-bedroom family home with multiple living areas, a double internal access garage, generous outdoor entertaining spaces and a spacious master suite. Whether you choose to pursue this vision (subject to council approval) or explore an alternative design, the initial planning has already been undertaken.\r\n\r\nThe existing three-bedroom home offers flexibility while you carry out your own investigations. Renovate, rebuild or landbank for the future - the choice is yours.\r\n\r\nThe location further strengthens this opportunity. Just minutes from Waiake Beach, Long Bay Regional Park, Browns Bay village, quality schools and excellent transport connections, you will be securing a position within a tightly held coastal community that continues to attract strong demand.\r\n\r\nOffered on an \"as is, where is\" basis, this property will appeal to purchasers who recognise the long-term value of premium land and have the vision to realise its full potential.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this opportunity to secure a foothold in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nConcept plans are indicative only, and purchasers should complete their own due diligence and obtain all necessary approvals.\r\n\r\nFor concept plans and further information, please copy and paste the following link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/XXM6",
